# Per-session scratch directories (e.g. .scratch-w4w/) hold throwaway probe
# scripts and must never be committed. `.scratch-w4w/*probe.ts` landed in
# git by accident via a blanket checkpoint commit; this keeps that from
# happening again for any session's scratch directory.
.scratch-*/
